+ranked endpoint. Raw red markers are insufficient: red members of a chain
+containing blue lie down and do not block. Protected native witness replay
+changes nine final cells when this intermediate is replaced with all red
+markers (`checks/eb373570e72b/causal/witness.json` in the return).
